{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13213150","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13213150","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1321315001:1":{"text":"말씀하신 가루콩열매를 따왔어요! 겸사겸사 열매를 훔쳐먹는 새들도 쫓아냈고요!","source_cn":"我们采到你说的粉面豆果了！顺便赶跑了那些偷吃的坏鸟！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2DEE577C65C9DE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321315002:1":{"text":"그것 참 다행이네요. 드디어 한시름 놓았어요! 여러분, 감사합니다!","source_cn":"那可太好了，大伙总算不用为这事发愁了！谢谢各位了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DDD98C1AA6A88B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321315003:1":{"text":"어라, 조금 전 화이트 베어 여관으로 가져갈 식재료는요? 이미 배달 가신 건가요?","source_cn":"咦，刚才那批要送到白熊旅店的食材呢？已经送过去了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA93DBAFCD01401A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321315004:1":{"text":"아, 맞아요. 그 식재료 중에 썩기 쉬운 재료가 있어서 직원에게 먼저 배달을 가라고 했어요. 여러분이 이렇게 빨리 돌아오실 줄 몰랐거든요.","source_cn":"哦，是啊。那批食材里有一些容易腐坏的菜，我就让手底下的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CE6EF03ACBA392D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321315005:1":{"text":"그 직원이 돌아오면 여러분이 따오신 열매를 다시 배달하라고 할게요.","source_cn":"等他回来之后，我会让他再把你们摘的这些果子送过去的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F7E08979B83F612","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321315006:1":{"text":"아니에요, 어차피 여관으로 돌아가야 하니 저희가 직접 가지고 가도록 할게요.","source_cn":"不用啦，反正我们也要回旅店，直接带回去就好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97E23103D7263BCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321315007:1":{"text":"거참, 죄송해서 어쩌죠...","source_cn":"哎呀，这怎么好意思呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABD878D77A05E3E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321315008:1":{"text":"혹시 여관으로 돌아가시는 김에 제 부탁 하나만 들어주실 수 있으신가요? 마침 가시는 길이에요!","source_cn":"不过既然你们要回旅店，能顺便帮我一个忙吗？正好顺路！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DA8798E5FFF2D02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1321315008":{"text":"혹시 여관으로 돌아가시는 김에 제 부탁 하나만 들어주실 수 있으신가요? 마침 가시는 길이에요!","source_cn":"不过既然你们要回旅店，能顺便帮我一个忙吗？正好顺路！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DA8798E5FFF2D02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321315009:1":{"text":"이번에 배달을 간 사람은 새로 들어온 사람이고 혼자서 배달을 간 건 처음이라 걱정이 되어서요. 괜찮으시면 신경 좀 써주실 수 있으실까요?","source_cn":"这次负责运货的是个新人，头一次独自送货。我有点不放心，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6CFC9AEBFB63AA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321315010:1":{"text":"모든 게 순조롭다면 좋겠지만 만약 무슨 일이 생긴다면 다시 여러분께 도움을 청할 수밖에 없을 거예요.","source_cn":"要是一切顺利就再好不过了。万一出点什么事，只能再请你们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F00D3C804382177","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321315011:1":{"text":"별것 아니네요! 기사 치피가 있으니 아무 일도 없을 거예요!","source_cn":"小事一桩！有骑士满满在，绝对不会出事的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6F3D77CF86748C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:0:1":{"text":"조금 전엔 죄송하다며!","source_cn":"刚才你还说不好意思呢！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x36113D80896E61A7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"조금 전엔 죄송하다며!","female":"조금 전엔 죄송하다며!","variant_male_record_index":"69152","variant_female_record_index":"69153","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:1:2":{"text":"얘기해 봐, 난 도와주는 걸 좋아해","source_cn":"说吧，我就喜欢助人为乐","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE49253A428EBFF96","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"얘기해 봐, 난 도와주는 걸 좋아해","female":"얘기해 봐, 난 도와주는 걸 좋아해","variant_male_record_index":"69154","variant_female_record_index":"69155","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:商人瓦迪姆":{"text":"상인 바딤","source":"商人瓦迪姆","status":"matched_d